## What Requires a Database

The following controls require PostgreSQL (`DATABASE_URL`) to work reliably:

| Control | Works Without DB | Works With DB |
|---|---|---|
| Global in-memory RPM/TPM | Yes (single replica) | Yes (all replicas) |
| Per-key RPM/TPM enforcement | Partial (single replica only) | Yes |
| Per-key budget cap | No | Yes |
| Budget reset on schedule | No | Yes |
| Budget alerts / callbacks | No | Yes |
| `/spend/keys` API | No | Yes |

