## Recommended V1 Configuration (if proceeding)

```json
// Per-department key — issue one per team at v1 launch
{
  "key_alias": "team-<department>",
  "models": ["ROMTech AI Standard", "ROMTech AI Fast"],
  "max_budget": 200.00,
  "budget_duration": "monthly",
  "rpm_limit": 60,
  "tpm_limit": 100000,
  "metadata": { "department": "<department>", "cost_centre": "<code>" }
}
```

```yaml
# Global circuit breaker — add to litellm_routing_config.yaml
litellm_settings:
  rpm_limit: 1000       # Adjust based on pilot usage data
  tpm_limit: 5000000    # Adjust based on pilot usage data
```
